    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**Excess Return** — your rename, carried through to the glossary. Same number, plainer word, because clients kept asking what alpha meant.\n\nSized bigger than its neighbours because you said the number IS the product. Worth noting: it is also the number on this screen with the least support underneath it — excess return needs a benchmark, and no DataSource supplies one.",
